descriptions=['The student writes a small question. No model request happens until Run query() is pressed.','The browser sends only the prompt to its own local server. It never receives the API key.','The server validates the input and allows only one active query.','The agent function calls query exactly once. The SDK launches its local runtime; it does not create a Managed Agents resource.','The local runtime makes the model request. tools: [] disables built-in tools in this lesson.','Claude returns model output and usage. This cloud boundary is separate from the browser-to-host connection.','for await...of consumes SDK messages. Assistant text and the final result are different message types.','The server forwards a small, explicit event projection as newline-delimited JSON. It does not stream raw runtime configuration.','The UI renders text safely and reports success only from a successful final SDK result.']
document('/architecture.html','Trace the <em>UML workflow.</em>','Follow the participants from left to right and the messages from top to bottom. The SDK runtime runs locally; model inference uses the Claude API.', '<div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/architecture.svg" download>Download the UML diagram (SVG)</a><a class="button" href="/walkthrough.html">See matching source snippets →</a></div><div class="diagram"><img src="/architecture.svg" alt="Nine-step UML sequence: student, browser, Node host, local SDK runtime and Claude API"></div><section>'+''.join(f'<article class="step"><span class="number">{i+1:02}</span><h3>{escape(label.split(". ",1)[1])}</h3><p>{escape(description)}</p></article>' for i,((a,b,label),description) in enumerate(zip(arrows,descriptions)))+'</section>'+actions(('/','← Run the lab'),('/walkthrough.html','Explain the code →')))

